config REKERNEL
	bool "Re:Kernel support"
	depends on FREEZER
	default n
	help
	  Re:Kernel provides a Netlink server for tombstone analysis.
	  It monitors frozen processes' Binder transactions and signals,
	  sending events to userspace via Netlink (UNIT 22-26, port 100).

	  Only enable if you need Re:Kernel integration for your device.